{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEPJ8ztshDHxELQW3Gsb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：在济州方言里，“지슬”的意思是马铃薯（土豆），标准韩语叫“감자”。** 一共搜了 3 次。\n\n- 头两次用韩语搜，结果里没有直接写出“지슬=감자”，只查到吴蔑（오멸）导演的电影《지슬》讲的是济州 4·3 事件，台词全用济州方言。\n- 第 3 次用英语搜，英文维基百科的 *Jiseul* 词条说片名就是济州话“土豆”的意思。KoreanClass101 的一课里也说“지실”在济州方言里是土豆。不同来源写法不一样，有“지슬”和“지실”两种。\n\n来源：\n- [Jiseul – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiseul)\n- [KoreanClass101 – How Many Varieties of Korean Are There?](https://www.koreanclass101.com/lesson/korean-teachers-answer-your-questions-5-how-many-dialects-of-korean-are-there)\n- [首尔新闻：采访电影《지슬》导演吴蔑](https://m.seoul.co.kr/news/2013/02/21/20130221023001)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1109, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7129, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1109}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:50:05.216Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEPJ8kmCvxxApRFAsLP9"}
